      "eliminated_obligations": [
        "Constructs the actual p2 and p2*p3 v lower tables on a single finite rectangular half-open mesh, using the existing qVLo supplier even across mu.",
        "Proves finite cap range using the actual original stored cap alphabet, with inherited Theta fallback kept.",
        "Proves originalSeed <= effective cap <= actual ideal v - buffer and explicit errors (3/2)*Delta+buffer or 3*Delta+buffer on the original selected guards.",
        "Chooses a single rational positive buffer and one mesh before every N/history for each positive exponent tolerance; existing d.e is fixed first.",
        "Proves own-ancestor cap persistence, first-two/rank-three staging, exact unsupported inheritance, original decision retention for N>=1 and unconditional even decisions."
      ],
      "remaining_premises": [
        "OriginalData is the unchanged existing constructor data, not a completeness/history/full87 record.",
        "The pre-N existence theorem fixes a positive existing rational d.e and positive tolerance eta.",
        "Cap approximation is on actual selectedThird plus the original secondGuard or thirdGuard; these source events are retained, not assumed to cover full87.",
        "Physical preservation of an already accepted old decision uses N>=1.",
        "No all22 signed integral/density estimate or required all higher selected-square licence is assumed or concluded."
      ]
    },
